# cosmou
===
 CosmoU – The most beautiful way to play Wii U games on PC.  A free Cemu frontend with Liquid Glass design, automatic setup, multiple view modes (including a Wii U-style home menu), and simple per-game settings. Built for nostalgia and ease of use.
